The two scripts of ex7/script_merope are adapted from the examples of
Mérope. They referred to its licence through a License.txt file that
does not exist in this repository. They now carry the same reference to
the licence of Mérope as the scripts of mm-opera-hpc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
